<article class="env-lemma" id="0D1Z">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0D1Z">Lemma <span data-tag="0D1Z">75.26.3</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. Let $E \in D(\mathcal{O}_ X)$ be perfect. The function </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \chi _ E : |X| \longrightarrow \mathbf{Z},\quad x \longmapsto \sum (-1)^ i \beta _ i(x)  \]
</div>
  <p> is locally constant on $X$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
